---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: How to get in touch with Kristiina Martin.
---
<h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>
<p class="section-lede">The easiest way to reach me is on LinkedIn. I am based in {{ site.location }}.</p>

<ul class="contact-list">
  {%- for l in site.links %}
  <li><a class="contact-link" href="{{ l.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ l.label }}</a></li>
  {%- endfor %}
  {%- if site.email %}
  <li><a class="contact-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
  {%- endif %}
</ul>
